+  ## values remain introspectable; and a consumer generated from the same
+  ## interface -- a repc replica, say -- declares the property with its enum
+  ## type and converts on arrival.
+  when isEnumType(T): $QBuiltinMetaType.Int else: $QBuiltinMetaType.resolve(T)
+
